OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver's lift helps officer
OL,4,Acatch wanted thief
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lift from a van driver helped police
OL,7,Fcatch a thief who was wanted for a
OL,8,Fseries of shoplifting offences.
OL,10,FPolice said officers were on patrol in
OL,11,Fthe Woodthorpe area of Nottinghamshire
OL,12,Fat about 12:30 GMT on 5 November when
OL,13,Fthey spotted 34-year-old Arron
OL,14,FPriestley riding a bike.
OL,16,FThey started chasing him, but when a
OL,17,Fpassing builder stopped and asked if he
OL,18,Fcould assist, officer Steve Dennis
OL,19,Fjumped in and continued his pursuit in
OL,20,Fthe van.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
